- Quality: Add explicit ownership, lifecycle, load-order, package, and line-budget contracts for the new modules without increasing the 375-global browser baseline.
- Reliability: Add direct regex-selection, debounce disposal, child-order reconciliation, hierarchy ownership, browser fixture, localization, and extreme-library performance coverage.
- Security: Refresh CSP readiness for 177 scanned first-party files while retaining zero inline events, inline scripts, and style attributes.


###2026.08.11.06
## FolderView Plus 2026.08.11.06
