- Refactor: Add `runtime.live-refresh.js` to own cadence, page-visibility gating, in-flight exclusion, release delay, snapshots, and disposal while each surface retains its own fetch and reconciliation policy.
- Reliability: Preserve default created-order behavior, explicit sort and pin ordering, Docker new-container reconciliation, incremental runtime refresh, and pagehide cleanup.
### Enforcement and regression coverage
- Quality: Ratchet `docker.js` from 8,839 to 8,028 lines, `vm.js` from 4,010 to 3,945 lines, and `dashboard.js` from 3,173 to 3,152 lines.
- Quality: Reduce cross-entrypoint function-name overlap from 46/9/8 to 40/6/6 and add explicit lifecycle, load-order, package, and line-budget contracts for the extracted modules.
- Quality: Add direct ordering, refresh lifecycle, extraction ownership, Docker layout, privacy, and browser fixture coverage for the new boundaries.
- Security: Regenerate CSP readiness after Docker line movement while retaining zero inline events, inline scripts, and style attributes.


