- Test: Added browser coverage that verifies neutral computed text and border colors, zero inherited margins, and tightly grouped layout controls.


###2026.07.21.03
- Feature: Reworked the Docker and VM Dashboard action rail into four focused controls for layout, expand or collapse all, running-only filtering, and a consolidated View options menu.
- UI/UX: Replaced blind seven-layout cycling with a named layout selector, moved health emphasis, compact density, Reset view, and Settings into a compact anchored popover, and disabled Reset view when no temporary view state needs clearing.
- UI/UX: Increased desktop and mobile action targets, added clear selected and pending states, prevented short widgets from requiring a seven-button scroll rail, and collapsed narrow widgets to the essential expand and View options controls.
- Accessibility: Added explicit pressed and selected semantics, visible keyboard focus, arrow-key layout navigation, Escape and outside-click dismissal, focus restoration, localized labels, and responsive touch-friendly controls.
- Reliability: Reused the existing verified Dashboard preference path for explicit layout choices, retained optimistic rollback on failed saves, and surfaced failures through the shared themed toast primitive.
- Localization: Added complete Dashboard action-rail and layout-selector coverage across all 18 shipped language catalogs and advanced the source catalog to revision 2026.07.21.1.
