###2026.05.26.01
- Fix: Clear stale Docker folder update indicators after bulk updates by ignoring saved folder update metadata when live dockerman runtime state is unknown during post-update reconciliation.
- Fix: Keep polling live Docker update status during the post-update reconcile window so folders refresh again once Unraid reports the final up-to-date state.
- Regression guard: Add Docker runtime tests for stale update clearing, host update-cell recovery, and post-update live polling.


###2026.05.22.05
- Fix: Add a Settings blank-page watchdog that reports `FVPLUS-SET-BLANK-001` with visible-section, root, topbar, and setup-assistant diagnostics instead of leaving a silent blank page.
- Fix: Keep Settings visible when the first-run setup assistant fails to render, reporting `FVPLUS-SET-WIZARD-001` as a degraded state so users can still access configuration.
- Regression guard: Cover Settings blank-watchdog state tracking and setup-assistant degraded fallback behavior.


###2026.05.22.04
- Fix: Restore full-width Docker folder preview borders so bordered preview rows extend across the folder field as before.
- Regression guard: Ensure Docker CSS does not shrink single-row folder preview borders to content width.


###2026.05.22.03
- Fix: Pass the shared utility helpers into Docker preview actions so folder preview rendering can resolve action preferences during bootstrap.
- Regression guard: Cover the Docker preview action utility dependency so `utils` cannot be referenced before it is provided.


###2026.05.22.02
- Fix: Scope the extracted Settings section registry so it cannot collide with `folderviewplus.js` top-level identifiers during browser bootstrap.
- Fix: Normalize legacy Docker preview status values like `hide`, `off`, `false`, and `0` to the same hidden state as `Hide status`.
- Regression guard: Add coverage for the scoped Settings registry and Docker preview status alias handling.


###2026.05.22.01
- Fix: Prevent Settings bootstrap failure when diagnostics loads before the main Settings runtime defines HTML, timestamp, JSON, or download helpers.
- Fix: Make Docker preview `Hide status` apply across all preview modes, including compact cards and live refresh updates.
- UX: Keep single-row Docker preview borders wrapped to preview content instead of stretching across empty table columns.
- Regression guard: Cover early diagnostics helper fallbacks and Docker preview status visibility behavior.


###2026.05.21.06
- Fix: Prevent Settings bootstrap failure when diagnostics loads before the main Settings runtime defines `showError`.
- Regression guard: Ensure the diagnostics module uses local safe error fallbacks during early bootstrap.


###2026.05.21.05
- UX: Add Settings search aliases for recent support terms like hide status, WebUI/console/logs, native organizer, dashboard overlap, and bulk apply update.
- UX: Add native Docker Organizer status and manual sync controls to the Operations workspace.
- Fix: Replace Docker advanced popup inline action handlers with delegated runtime actions.
- Fix: Require import review acknowledgement for destructive deletes and untrusted exports even when preview-first is disabled.
- Quality: Add native organizer diagnostics, performance budget cards, expanded browser smoke coverage, and shared preview action preference handling.


###2026.05.21.03
- Fix: Make Docker only-icon preview `Hide status` actively remove existing status badges during live refreshes.
- Regression guard: Cover the hidden-status refresh path so saved folders do not keep stale status symbols.


###2026.05.21.02
- Feature: Add opt-in advanced Dashboard member previews with WebUI, console, logs, update, ports, volumes, and CPU/MEM graph details.
- Feature: Add a per-folder only-icon status setting so icon-only previews can show symbols, grayscale stopped containers, or no status marker.
- Compatibility: Sync FolderView Plus Docker folders to Unraid's native Docker Organizer on a best-effort basis and include native organizer status in diagnostics.
- Quality: Harden Docker graph/stat listeners so popup and Dashboard previews clean up stale chart updates and use a CPU core fallback.
- Compatibility: Preserve Unraid as the owner of Docker `userprefs.cfg` while still reading current order and maintaining autostart state.
- Security: Sanitize Docker advanced popup runtime metadata, links, icons, and bind mount mappings before rendering.


