###2026.03.13.9
- Add `3rd Party icons` browser in Folder settings:
  - new button next to `Built-in icons`,
  - lists user folders from `/boot/config/plugins/folderview.plus/third-party-icons`,
  - click a folder to reveal and pick icons within that folder.
- Add secure server endpoint:
  - `server/third_party_icons.php` supports folder listing, icon listing, and safe image serving,
  - blocks path traversal and only allows common image extensions.

###2026.03.13.8
- Tighten folder-editor left alignment again:
  - force all text/number/select controls to anchor left (no auto-centering margins),
  - force switch-button wrappers to anchor left as well,
