###2026.03.09.7
- Fix package archive path layout to install files under `/usr/local/...` (active Unraid plugin path).
- Prior package variants wrote to `/local/...`, which updated plugin version but did not replace active runtime files.

###2026.03.09.6
- Replace folder editor alignment fallback with float-based forced left column:
